{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102550","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102550","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1410255001:1":{"text":"Yup, hop on! We'll take the minecart for a bit.","source_cn":"快上来，咱们得乘着矿车遛上一段。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3547C1BC46DA65BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410255002:1":{"text":"Is this thing safe? It won't tip over, right?","source_cn":"这东西……安全吗？没有侧翻的风险吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0888B76C5B55CB39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410255003:1":{"text":"Well, I haven't maintained it in a while, so...","source_cn":"你要这么问，我确实很久没检修了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A24433D36962152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410255004:1":{"text":"Don't joke about that!","source_cn":"可别开这种玩笑啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117D3EBE03EE0068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410255005:1":{"text":"Relax, I use it all the time! If it tips over today, well... bad luck. So, are you feeling lucky today?","source_cn":"反正我经常坐它，要是今天翻车了，只能说运气不好，你们的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD185AB62DA15C103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1410255005":{"text":"Relax, I use it all the time! If it tips over today, well... bad luck. So, are you feeling lucky today?","source_cn":"反正我经常坐它，要是今天翻车了，只能说运气不好，你们的运气怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD185AB62DA15C103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410255006:1":{"text":"Then there's nothing to worry about!","source_cn":"那还怕什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B821F5345F61DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410255008:1":{"text":"I'm not so sure about this...","source_cn":"唔……稍微有些担心呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CC2D9DDBA44B007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410255009:1":{"text":"Chippy thinks it'll be a blast!","source_cn":"我觉得肯定很有趣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB348796962D436CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410255010:1":{"text":"That's the spirit! It's time to feel the breeze at top speed! So, hold tight! It's going to be a bumpy ride!","source_cn":"没错，好好享受速度带来的微风吧。坐稳，我要开车了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80F9060CCBDBD045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":""